		(descr "Murata MEJ2S single-output SIP. Pins 1, 2, 5 and 7 at 2.54 mm. Pin 6 is not fitted and has no hole. The recommended-footprint drawing prints 0.6 mm plus or minus 0.15 mm next to the inch pair 0.024 plus or minus 0.006, and that pair is the hole. Pad diameter is 1.8 mm because the same extract does not label a pad. Body courtyard is 19.65 by 10.05 mm centred on the pin span. The extract does not give a separate pin-1 to body-end dimension.")
